# Export output. The Godot project is LTW_Test/, and its export preset writes
# here - a sibling of the project rather than a folder inside it, so build
# artefacts can never land in the Godot filesystem and be imported back as
# content. The path is relative in export_presets.cfg, so it resolves the same
# on every checkout without naming one machine's disk.
#
# Builds are uploaded to itch, not committed: an export is mostly the engine
# template, and it is reproducible from the commit it was built at. Docs/building.md
# is the procedure.
Builds/
